# Personal translation packs.
#
# A translation you own may be side-loaded onto your own device — that is
# format-shifting a book you bought. Committing it here is redistribution:
# this repo is public, and git history is permanent, so a file added and
# later deleted is still published.
#
# Nothing matching these patterns may be committed. Packs cleared for
# redistribution must be added explicitly with `git add -f` AND recorded in
# THIRD-PARTY.md with their licence.
packs/personal/
*.personal.db
*.personal.json
translations/*.db
!translations/README.md

# Build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
